1
00:00:00,086 --> 00:00:03,086
- Good night, Sheldon.
- Good night, Leonard.

2
00:00:06,968 --> 00:00:08,218
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

3
00:00:09,429 --> 00:00:11,389
- Hey, Leonard?
- Hi, Penny.

4
00:00:11,556 --> 00:00:13,806
(Penny:)Hey, I just wanted to make sure
you were okay.

5
00:00:13,975 --> 00:00:16,105
(Leonard:)I'm fine.

6
00:00:17,228 --> 00:00:19,568
I am so sorry about what happened.

7
00:00:19,731 --> 00:00:21,361
(Leonard:)It's not your fault.

8
00:00:21,524 --> 00:00:23,944
(Penny:)Yes, it is.
That's why I broke up with him.

9
00:00:24,110 --> 00:00:26,700
(Penny:)He always does stuff like that.

10
00:00:27,530 --> 00:00:29,950
(Leonard:)So why was he at your party?

11
00:00:31,325 --> 00:00:34,615
(Penny:)Well, I ran into him last week...

12
00:00:34,787 --> 00:00:38,247
...and he was just all apologetic
about how he's changed.

13
00:00:38,416 --> 00:00:41,506
(Penny:)He was just going on and on,
and I believed him.

14
00:00:41,669 --> 00:00:44,839
(Penny:)And I'm an idiot,
because I always believe guys like that.

15
00:00:45,465 --> 00:00:48,055
And I can't go back to my party
because he's there.

16
00:00:48,217 --> 00:00:52,217
And I know you don't wanna hear this. I'm
upset and really drunk and I just wanna...

17
00:00:53,347 --> 00:01:01,027
[SOBBING]

